# Pinned rather than left to the plugin default, so that this file states the
# baseline outright: it is the only line that differs in kind from
# BuchiAutomizerPasttel.epf.in, and a future change of default cannot silently
# turn the ULR baseline into something else. A release built without the
# PaSTTeL backend simply does not know this key and ignores it.
/instance/de.uni_freiburg.informatik.ultimate.plugins.generator.buchiautomizer/Rank\ synthesis\ backend=LASSORANKER

